---
title: "flagAnomalousActivity - AI Anomaly Detection (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive_input: receive userId, activityType, timestamp, recentActivity[]
    q_receive_input --> q_build_prompt: construct prompt with recent activity patterns
    q_build_prompt --> q_call_ai: invoke Genkit AI prompt with safety settings BLOCK_NONE
    q_call_ai --> q_parse_output: AI returns isAnomalous and reason
    q_parse_output --> q_anomalous: isAnomalous = true
    q_anomalous --> [*]: return isAnomalous=true, reason
    q_parse_output --> q_normal: isAnomalous = false
    q_normal --> [*]: return isAnomalous=false

    note right of q_call_ai
        INV-001: AI evaluates unexpected login/logout times
        INV-002: AI evaluates unusually frequent activity
        INV-003: AI evaluates inconsistent patterns
        INV-004: all safety filters set to BLOCK_NONE (no content filtering)
    end note
